{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "4659230b9bb79185",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -40,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 2240,
			"height": 330,
			"label": "The screen, back to front (src/ui/main.gd:255-295)",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "37745ed7a0f005fb",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## 1 Map\n`MapView`, full rect, the world. Everything else draws over it.\n\n`src/ui/map_view.gd`"
		},
		{
			"id": "a279fe916f63b016",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## 2 Workspace\n`WindowManager`: one tab open at a time, docked left, back and forward walk the player's path. 24 panels registered (V5.2b: the audience scene, in audience_driver.gd), none edited when the shell changed.\n\n`src/ui/window_manager.gd`"
		},
		{
			"id": "6a8e2399923d653e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 960,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## 3 HUD\n`Hud`: title bar, sidebar, figure strip, legend, inbox, ribbon, portrait card and clock. A layout only: it owns no state.\n\n`src/ui/hud.gd`"
		},
		{
			"id": "b26dc72d261a92c1",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1440,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## 4 Screen stack\n`ScreenStack`: what owns the screen above the HUD. Ranks MAP -1, WORKSPACE 0, INBOX 1, PLACEMENT 2, SCENE 3, SYSTEM 4; the glossary tooltips are its last child.\n\n`src/ui/screen_stack.gd`"
		},
		{
			"id": "e2346381bb8eb382",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1920,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## 5 Dev console\nF12, debug builds only, above everything.\n\n`src/ui/dev_console.gd`",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e8a42c4c4a198b06",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "### Domains\nWhich tab sits under which heading is one table: `TABLE` in `src/ui/domains.gd`. 22 tabs in 14 rows; a window in no row becomes its own one-tab domain. A scene (the summit) is in no domain. Drawn on [[shell]]."
		},
		{
			"id": "fbe6e9cfe1f5a245",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 620,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 150,
			"text": "### Tab page\nA scroll around a panel that knows nothing about it, plus the fold mark: `src/ui/tab_page.gd`."
		},
		{
			"id": "b90d94578d1a5275",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 960,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 430,
			"text": "### The chrome\n- `src/ui/title_bar.gd`: back, forward, where you are, why the clock is held, date, speeds, save, menu\n- `src/ui/sidebar.gd`: portrait card, Inbox, Agenda, then the domains\n- `src/ui/top_bar.gd`: the figure strip, folds into +N\n- `src/ui/inbox.gd`: Decisions, Requests, Notes; a decision is never evicted\n- `src/ui/map_legend.gd`\n- `src/ui/ribbon.gd`: the day ribbon"
		},
		{
			"id": "0f04d28cd522179c",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1440,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "### Glossary tooltips\nA term is `[g=id]word[/g]`, drawn by `src/ui/term_text.gd`; the chain of tooltips is `src/ui/glossary_tip.gd`, three deep with locks. Ids are `data/glossary/terms.json`."
		},
		{
			"id": "e7d7e9cf72e69c7d",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 860,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 180,
			"file": "docs/panel-system.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "d2bc14cede183012",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 1440,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 180,
			"file": "docs/design/glossary-tooltips.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "016b6dad2ffefe7d",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 960,
			"y": 860,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 180,
			"file": "docs/design/decision-surfaces.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "a4097e080c550462",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "### Reading this\nLeft to right is back to front. A box names the node and its file. Documents are the grey cards below: [[panel-system]] section 25 is the shell in prose; the two design notes belong to the Gameplay session and are only linked here."
		}
	],
